' UC-IAL-02 — Change User Account Status

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|WAH Central Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access account lifecycle administration;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify administrator authority;
if (Authorized?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present access-denied result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Present user search/selection interface;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.0 Enter search criteria;

|WAHrden System|
:2.1 Search centralized identities;
if (Matching account found?) then (No [EF-02])
  :Present no-match result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :Present matching results;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.2 Select centralized user account;

|WAHrden System|
:2.3 Present current lifecycle status & options;

|WAH Central Administrator|
:3.0 Select requested status transition\n(Active, Inactive, or Deactivated);

|WAHrden System|
:3.1 Evaluate requested change against lifecycle rules;
if (Transition permitted?) then (No [EF-03])
  :Present invalid-transition result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :3.2 Present proposed status change & system impact;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Confirm status change?) then (No / Cancel [EF-04])
  :Cancel status change;
  kill
else (Yes [3.3])
  :Confirm status change;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:4.0 Attempt to apply lifecycle status change;
if (Processing successful?) then (No [EF-05])
  :Retain existing status & present processing failure;
  kill
else (Yes)
  if (Resulting status == Deactivated?) then (Yes [4.1])
    :Invalidate active WAHrden sessions;
  else (No)
    :Retain existing session states;
  endif
  
  |Database / Audit|
  :4.2 Record status change & audit trail;
  
  |WAHrden System|
  :4.3 Present resulting account status;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:Review updated status confirmation;
stop
@enduml
